d">Blog</a><a href="/case-studies" class="rounded px-3 py-2 text-[16px] font-bold text-ink transition-colors hover:text-gold">Case Studies</a><a href="/resources" class="rounded px-3 py-2 text-[16px] font-bold text-ink transition-colors hover:text-gold">SBC Knowledge</a><a href="/contact" class="rounded px-3 py-2 text-[16px] font-bold text-ink transition-colors hover:text-gold">Contact</a><a href="/contact" class="ml-2 bg-gold px-4 py-2.5 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-paper transition-colors hover:bg-gold-tint">Discuss Your Project</a></nav><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Toggle navigation" class="rounded p-2 text-ink lg:hidden"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-menu size-5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16"></path><path d="M4 12h16"></path><path d="M4 19h16"></path></svg></button></div></header><div class="bg-ink"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://sbcgroup.in/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Case Studies","item":"https://sbcgroup.in/case-studies"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Unlocking Sales Growth for a Mid-Sized Manufacturing Business"}]}</script><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="shell py-3 text-paper/70 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px]"><ol class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5"><li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><a href="/" class="transition-colors hover:text-gold">Home</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right size-3.5 shrink-0 text-paper/40" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><a href="/case-studies" class="transition-colors hover:text-gold">Case Studies</a></li><li class="flex items-center gap-1.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right size-3.5 shrink-0 text-paper/40" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span class="font-medium text-paper" aria-current="page">Unlocking Sales Growth for a Mid-Sized Manufacturing Business</span></li></ol></nav></div><main><section class="bg-ink py-14"><div class="shell"><div data-visible="false" class="reveal max-w-3xl"><a href="/msme-consulting" class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-[oklch(0.82_0.11_92.89)] transition-colors hover:text-gold-tint">Business Operations (MSME)</a><h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-paper md:text-[2.5rem]">Unlocking Sales Growth for a Mid-Sized Manufacturing Business</h1><p class="mt-3 text-[12px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-paper/70">Manufacturing • Industrial Products<!-- --> · <!-- -->Business Audit • Sales &amp; Distribution Strategy<!-- --> · Client: <!-- -->Confidential</p></div></div></section><section class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint"><div class="shell"><div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-3"><div class="min-w-0 space-y-5 md:col-span-2"><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 id="challenge" class="scroll-mt-24 pt-3 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">The Challenge</h2></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">A mid-sized manufacturing business with established operations and documented processes was struggling to grow its top line. The founder recognised something was off — but couldn&#x27;t pinpoint where.</p></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><div class="border border-gold bg-gold-wash p-6"><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-gold-deep">The Key Question</p><p class="mt-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-ink">Why is a well-run business not growing at the pace it should?</p></div></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 id="approach" class="scroll-mt-24 pt-3 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Our Approach</h2></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">SBC conducted a 45-Minute Complementary Business Audit covering people, process, systems, and strategy. The audit included the founder and HR leadership.</p></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><ul class="space-y-2"><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>Sales structure and coverage</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>Dealer and distributor network depth and activity</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>Channel engagement and incentive design</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>Market penetration vs. potential</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>Founder dependency on key accounts</span></li></ul></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">What emerged quickly: internal operations were largely in order. SOPs existed. Accountability structures were functional. The business was not broken inside.</p></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">The bottleneck was outside — in the market.</p></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 id="findings" class="scroll-mt-24 pt-3 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">What We Found</h2></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><ul class="space-y-2"><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>Dealer and distributor network existed but was underactivated — relationships were passive, not managed</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>No structured channel engagement or performance tracking</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>Sales effort was reactive — responding to inbound rather than driving outbound</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>Key account relationships were concentrated at the founder level with no team coverage beneath</span></li></ul></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 id="strategy" class="scroll-mt-24 pt-3 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Strategic Direction</h2></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">The recommended direction was built around:</p></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"><span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-flex items-center border border-gold-deep/40 bg-gold-wash px-3.5 py-2 text-[13px] font-medium leading-snug text-ink">Active Channel Management</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-3.5 shrink-0 text-gold-deep" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-flex items-center border border-gold-deep/40 bg-gold-wash px-3.5 py-2 text-[13px] font-medium leading-snug text-ink">Distributor Performance Framework</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-3.5 shrink-0 text-gold-deep" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-flex items-center border border-gold-deep/40 bg-gold-wash px-3.5 py-2 text-[13px] font-medium leading-snug text-ink">Sales Team Activation</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-3.5 shrink-0 text-gold-deep" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-flex items-center border border-gold-deep/40 bg-gold-wash px-3.5 py-2 text-[13px] font-medium leading-snug text-ink">Account Coverage Mapping</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-3.5 shrink-0 text-gold-deep" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="inline-flex items-center border border-gold-deep/40 bg-gold-wash px-3.5 py-2 text-[13px] font-medium leading-snug text-ink">Pipeline Visibility</span></span></div></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 id="recommendations" class="scroll-mt-24 pt-3 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Key Recommendations</h2></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><ul class="space-y-2"><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>Audit the existing dealer and distributor network — identify who is active, who is dormant, and why</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>Design a channel engagement framework with defined targets, visit cadence, and incentive structure</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>Shift sales effort from reactive to structured — territory coverage, account mapping, and pipeline tracking</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>Reduce founder dependency on key relationships by building team-level account ownership</span></li><li class="flex gap-2 text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal"><span class="mt-2.5 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span><span>Create visibility into the sales pipeline so decisions are data-driven, not gut-driven</span></li></ul></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><h2 id="outcome" class="scroll-mt-24 pt-3 font-display text-2xl font-semibold text-ink">Outcome</h2></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">The 45-minute audit surfaced what months of internal review had not: the business did not have an operations problem. It had a sales and distribution problem — and a clear path to address it.</p></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><p class="text-[15.5px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">This is the same diagnostic-to-implementation approach SBC uses across every<!-- --> <a href="/msme-consulting" class="font-semibold text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">Business Operations (MSME)</a> <!-- -->engagement — see<!-- --> <a href="/msme-consulting#gap360-method" class="font-semibold text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">our GAP360™ method</a>.</p></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal "><p class="text-[13px] italic leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">Client identity and proprietary commercial information have been withheld for confidentiality.</p></div><aside aria-labelledby="author-bio-heading" class="mt-14 max-w-3xl border-t border-ink-tint pt-8"><h2 id="author-bio-heading" class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft">About the Author</h2><div class="mt-5 flex flex-col gap-5 border border-ink-tint bg-ink-wash p-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-start"><img src="/images/founder/sagar-burse-author.webp" alt="Sagar Burse, PhD, Founder and Principal Consultant of Sagar Burse Consulting" width="112" height="112" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aspect-square shrink-0 rounded-full border-2 border-gold object-cover"/><div class="min-w-0"><p class="font-display text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Sagar Burse, PhD</p><p class="mt-1 font-display text-[15px] italic text-ink-soft">Founder &amp; Principal Consultant, Sagar Burse Consulting (SBC)</p><p class="mt-3 text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Sagar Burse, PhD is the Founder and Principal Consultant of Sagar Burse Consulting (SBC), headquartered in Ahmedabad, Gujarat, advising institutions and founder-led businesses across institution building, strategic research and business operations.</p><p class="mt-3 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">PhD (Management), GLS University · MBA (Marketing), Gujarat University · UGC-NET and GSET qualified</p><div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-4"><a href="/founder" rel="author" class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">View Full Profile →</a><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/drsagarburse/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold">LinkedIn →</a></div></div></div></aside><div class="mt-14 border-t border-ink-tint pt-8"><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft">Related Case Study</p><a href="/case-studies/manufacturer-accountability-system" class="mt-2 inline-block font-display text-lg font-semibold text-ink transition-colors hover:text-gold-deep">Building an Accountability System for a Legacy Manufacturer<!-- --> →</a></div><div class="!mt-10"><a class="text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-gold-deep transition-colors hover:text-gold active" href="/case-studies" data-status="active" aria-current="page">← All Case Studies</a></div></div><div data-visible="false" class="reveal h-fit bg-ink-wash p-6 md:sticky md:top-24"><p class="text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-soft">In This Case Study</p><ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5"><li><a href="#challenge" class="flex gap-2 text-[14px] leading-snug text-charcoal transition-colors hover:text-gold-deep"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span>The Challenge</a></li><li><a href="#approach" class="flex gap-2 text-[14px] leading-snug text-charcoal transition-colors hover:text-gold-deep"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span>Our Approach</a></li><li><a href="#findings" class="flex gap-2 text-[14px] leading-snug text-charcoal transition-colors hover:text-gold-deep"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span>What We Found</a></li><li><a href="#strategy" class="flex gap-2 text-[14px] leading-snug text-charcoal transition-colors hover:text-gold-deep"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span>Strategic Direction</a></li><li><a href="#recommendations" class="flex gap-2 text-[14px] leading-snug text-charcoal transition-colors hover:text-gold-deep"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span>Key Recommendations</a></li><li><a href="#outcome" class="flex gap-2 text-[14px] leading-snug text-charcoal transition-colors hover:text-gold-deep"><span class="mt-2 h-1 w-1 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-gold-deep"></span>Outcome</a></li></ul><a href="/msme-consulting#book" class="mt-6 inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center bg-ink px-3 py-2.5 text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.1em] text-paper transition-colors hover:bg-charcoal">Book a Review</a></div></div></div></section><section id="book" aria-labelledby="cta-heading" class="section-y border-b border-ink-tint bg-gold-wash"><div class="shell"><div data-visible="false" class="reveal mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center"><h2 id="cta-heading" class="mt-4 font-display text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-tight text-ink md:text-[2.75rem]">Facing a similar challenge in your business?</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[17px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal">Tell us what you are planning. You will speak directly with Dr. Sagar Burse, not a sales team.</p><a href="/msme-consulting#book" class="mt-7 inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-gold px-8 py-4 text-[13px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-paper transition-colors hover:bg-gold-tint">Book a Review<!-- --> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div></div></section></mai